From 83cdf12443e5f5005668c9c7e87ab75ea6e1f199 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 22 Jul 2026 18:22:20 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add gamification: quests, streaks, upgrade meter, referral
 credits

- gamification_claims (idempotent unique tenant+key) + per-plan
  gamification_plan_settings (defaults when no row; covers future plans)
- Quest catalog + UTC-day streak engine derived entirely from existing data
  (usage_events, brand_kits, connected_accounts, scheduled_posts, videos)
- Rewards flow through grantCredits with per-plan multiplier; claims are
  server-verified and replay-proof
- Referrals ride the promo engine: personal REF- codes (ownerTenantId),
  self-redeem blocked, referrer paid in the same redemption transaction,
  in-app notification, per-redemption referrer amounts recorded
- 4 new feature kill switches (quests/streaks/referrals/progressMeter) +
  per-plan toggles, reward multiplier, referral amounts on the admin Plans
  tab (dynamic across current and future plans)
- AI Studio strip: quest checklist, streak flame + milestone claims,
  usage progress meter with upgrade CTA, invite-and-earn dialog
- Contract-first: openapi.yaml + regenerated clients (drift-clean)
- Tests: quests/streak/multiplier/claims, referral mint/self-redeem/payout/
  plan-disable, web card rendering + claims

